{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>Before YHWH.</b> Like \"a sheep burnt offering.\" <b>On the side of the altar, northward.</b> Opposite the table." "The sense of <b>and he shall slaughter:</b> the priest who slaughters it is one; <b>and they shall sprinkle</b> the blood — many. And so it is written: \"and the sons of Aaron presented.\"" "The sense of <b>at the entrance of the Tent of Meeting:</b> to exclude the incense altar."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:08:21.023401185Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}